IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q07-TXN-COUNT-TYPE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-N               PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-IDX             PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-LINE            PIC X(40) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-TYPE            PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-AMT-STR         PIC X(15) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-AMT             PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-DEP-CNT         PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-DEP-TOT         PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 WS-WD-CNT          PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-WD-TOT          PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 WS-INVALID-FLAG    PIC X VALUE "N".
01 WS-DISP-NUM        PIC Z(11)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-N
PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-N
    ACCEPT WS-LINE
    UNSTRING WS-LINE DELIMITED BY ALL SPACES
        INTO WS-TYPE WS-AMT-STR
    COMPUTE WS-AMT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-AMT-STR)
    IF WS-AMT < 0
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-INVALID-FLAG
    ELSE
        EVALUATE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TYPE))
            WHEN "D"
                ADD 1 TO WS-DEP-CNT
                ADD WS-AMT TO WS-DEP-TOT
            WHEN "W"
                ADD 1 TO WS-WD-CNT
                ADD WS-AMT TO WS-WD-TOT
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE "Y" TO WS-INVALID-FLAG
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF
END-PERFORM
IF WS-INVALID-FLAG = "Y"
    DISPLAY "INVALID BATCH"
ELSE
    MOVE WS-DEP-CNT TO WS-DISP-NUM
    DISPLAY "Deposit count: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-NUM)
    MOVE WS-DEP-TOT TO WS-DISP-NUM
    DISPLAY "Deposit total: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-NUM)
    MOVE WS-WD-CNT TO WS-DISP-NUM
    DISPLAY "Withdrawal count: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-NUM)
    MOVE WS-WD-TOT TO WS-DISP-NUM
    DISPLAY "Withdrawal total: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-NUM)
END-IF
STOP RUN.
